.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-server-snapshot-list - List snapshots and the snapshot quota


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro server snapshot list  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List snapshots and the snapshot quota

.PP
tr-ist-1: \fBquota\fR = number of snapshots allowed on the plan (add-on), snapshot ids are stable numbers derived by the API. Prepaid tr-ist-1 servers also return \fBpricing\fR {billing, free, extra_monthly_eur, extra_hourly_eur, billable}: the first snapshot(s) are free, each extra snapshot is charged hourly from the balance while it exists. 2.14.0 (Gyro Compute): snapshot ids are the platform's own ids; \fBname\fR is returned too.

.PP
API: GET /cloud/servers/{id}/snapshots (operationId listSnapshots, scope cloud_read)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for list


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	API base URL (env GYRO_API_URL)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
